[7.520806, "o", "\u001b[25G"]
[8.820837, "o", "\r\n"]
[8.820888, "o", "\r\nWhich capabilities should the AI client get?\r\n"]
[8.820953, "o", "  1) read: consultation only, no raw content (recommended)\r\n  2) read + write: also acknowledge, comment, tag, label, PCAP requests\r\n  3) read + sensitive: also Advanced Search, email content, PCAP download, audit events\r\n  4) all: read, sensitive, write and critical (requires the risk acknowledgement below)\r\n"]
[8.820982, "o", "\u001b[1G"]
[8.821033, "o", "\u001b[0JChoice [1]: \u001b[13G"]
[9.768641, "o", "1"]
[9.814734, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[9.81489, "o", "\r\nChecking the appliance with a signed GET /status...\r\n"]
[9.832534, "o", "OK: URL, TLS and tokens work with date format compact. Client entries will set DARKTRACE_DATE_FORMAT=compact.\r\n"]
[9.862783, "o", "\r\nSaved settings in /private/tmp/darktrace-setup-9MLze0/darktrace-mcp (token files are owner-only, mode 0600).\r\n"]
[9.865437, "o", "\r\nInstall into which clients? (numbers separated by commas, \"all\" or \"none\")\r\n"]
[9.86547, "o", "  1) Claude Desktop  [detected]\r\n  2) Claude Code  [detected]\r\n  3) Codex  [detected]\r\n"]
[9.865476, "o", "  4) Cursor  [detected]\r\n  5) VS Code\r\n"]
[9.865487, "o", "  6) Windsurf  [detected]\r\n  7) OpenCode  [detected]\r\n  8) Gemini CLI  [detected]\r\n"]
